Reproduction:
```js
// a.ts
console.log("hello");
```
```json5
// .parcelrc
{
  "extends": "@parcel/config-default",
  "transformers": {
    "*.{ts,tsx}": ["@parcel/transformer-typescript-tsc"]
  }
}
```

and then
`rm -rf dist .parcel-cache; yarn parcel build a.ts; yarn parcel watch a.ts; yarn parcel build a.ts`

Works fine without the typescript transformer.

Probably related to https://github.com/parcel-bundler/parcel/pull/5570 / #5311
